---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Website Terms | Hyperboards"
  description="Interim website-use principles for Hyperboards, pending confirmation of the operating entity and final legal review."
  noindex={true}
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Website terms"
    title="Clear boundaries for an introductory website."
    intro="This website is designed to begin direct acquisition conversations. Final terms must be issued by the confirmed operating entity before production launch."
    marker="T"
  />

  <section class="section legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <aside class="legal-status" role="note" aria-labelledby="terms-status-title" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pre-launch status</p>
        <h2 id="terms-status-title">These are provisional website-use principles.</h2>
        <p>
          They are not complete legal terms. The operating entity, effective date, jurisdiction,
          intellectual-property ownership, liability language and official contact must be confirmed
          by qualified counsel before the site is publicly indexed or used for production inquiries.
        </p>
      </aside>

      <article class="legal-copy" data-reveal>
        <section>
          <p class="section-number">01 / Purpose</p>
          <h2>Information and introductions</h2>
          <p>
            The website provides general information about the kinds of businesses Hyperboards may
            consider acquiring and offers a route for an introductory conversation. Website content
            is not financial, legal, tax, accounting, brokerage or investment advice.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <p class="section-number">02 / No transaction commitment</p>
          <h2>Published criteria are guidelines.</h2>
          <p>
            The $750K–$2M target EBITDA range and approximately $2M–$6M typical deal-value range are
            acquisition guidelines only. They are not an offer, valuation, promise to transact,
            financing commitment or assurance that a particular business will qualify.
          </p>
          <p>
            Any transaction would depend on mutual interest, verification, diligence, negotiated
            documents, required approvals and business-specific considerations.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <p class="section-number">03 / Confidentiality</p>
          <h2>An inquiry is not an NDA.</h2>
          <p>
            Hyperboards intends to handle initial conversations discreetly, but submitting a website
            form does not by itself create a fiduciary relationship, agency relationship or
            non-disclosure agreement. Highly sensitive documents should not be sent until appropriate
            protections and a secure sharing method are in place.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <p class="section-number">04 / Investor relationships</p>
          <h2>No securities offering.</h2>
          <p>
            General references to aligned capital partners are relationship-oriented and should not
            be understood as an offer to sell, or a solicitation of an offer to buy, any security or
            investment product. Any future opportunity would require separate, authorized materials
            and applicable legal review.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <p class="section-number">05 / Website use</p>
          <h2>Responsible use and content ownership</h2>
          <p>
            Visitors should use the website lawfully and should not attempt to disrupt, probe, scrape
            at harmful volume, gain unauthorized access to, or misuse the site or its forms. Final
            terms must identify the owner or authorized licensee of the Hyperboards name, website
            design, copy and other materials before asserting enforceable ownership rights.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <p class="section-number">06 / Availability and external links</p>
          <h2>No guarantee of uninterrupted access</h2>
          <p>
            Website availability, accuracy and completeness may change. Links to third-party services
            do not by themselves imply endorsement. Production terms should contain counsel-approved
            warranty and liability language suited to the actual entity, technology and jurisdiction.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <p class="section-number">07 / Entity and governing law</p>
          <h2>Required before launch</h2>
          <p>
            The legal entity providing this website, its business address, official contact, effective
            date, governing law and dispute provisions have not yet been approved for publication.
            Those details are launch blockers and must replace this interim section following legal
            review.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBand
    eyebrow="Acquisition criteria"
    title="See whether the broad profile fits."
    body="Review the financial guidelines, target sectors and characteristics Hyperboards considers before sharing business details."
    href="/what-we-acquire"
    label="View what we acquire"
  />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .legal-status {
    max-width: 64rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(199, 168, 91, 0.45);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background-color: var(--color-paper);
    background-image: var(--texture-paper);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .legal-status h2 {
    max-width: 22ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: var(--step-3);
  }

  .legal-status > p:last-child {
    max-width: 53rem;
  }

  .legal-copy {
    max-width: 54rem;
  }

  .legal-copy section {
    scroll-margin-top: 7rem;
  }

  .legal-copy section + section {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-copy h2 {
    max-width: 25ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    font-size: var(--step-3);
  }

  .section-number {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--color-forest);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  @media (min-width: 62rem) {
    .legal-copy {
      margin-left: clamp(2rem, 11vw, 11rem);
    }
  }
</style>
